    "en": {
      "trackName": "Lattern: Memory Grid Puzzle",
      "description": "Lattern is a 60-second daily memory ritual. Calm, precise, and deliberately not brain training.\n\nEach day, a grid lights its cells one by one. After it rests, you light the same path back from memory. The sequence builds as you go: three for the day, a little longer each round. Get it, and your Lattice fills in, a quiet pattern of light that grows day by day.\n\n• One new Lattern every day, the same for everyone\n• A gentle build-up, a few tries, never a harsh fail\n• The Lattice: your streak, as a calendar of light\n• Apple Watch and home-screen widgets\n• No accounts, no noise, no pressure\n\nLattern+ unlocks practice grids, 1,000 training levels, your full history, and removes ads.\n\nQuiet work. Same time tomorrow.\n\nPrivacy policy: https://lattern.app/privacy\nTerms of use: https://lattern.app/terms",
      "releaseNotes": "Small behind-the-scenes improvements to keep Lattern running smoothly. Same quiet daily puzzle.",
