    {
      "version": "1.1",
      "releaseNotes": "Game Center comes to Lattern: a quiet leaderboard and a few calm achievements, there if you want them, easy to ignore if you don't. Same time tomorrow.",
      "seenAt": "2026-06-13T16:49:45Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "1.2",
      "releaseNotes": "Opening Lattern is calmer now: a quiet welcome, then you light today's Lattern when you're ready.",
      "seenAt": "2026-06-14T23:21:14Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "1.3",
      "releaseNotes": "A clearer hint. When you use one, the whole step lights up at once with each cell numbered in order, so you can read the full path before you light it back.",
      "seenAt": "2026-06-16T16:03:47Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "1.4",
      "releaseNotes": "Sound, if you like it. The grid now plays soft, warm tones as the sequence lights and as you tap it back, with a gentle resolve when a Lattern is lit. Calm by design, it respects your mute switch, and you can toggle it in Settings.",
      "seenAt": "2026-06-17T17:54:26Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "1.5",
      "releaseNotes": "A steadier hint. Use one and the cells light up numbered in order and stay on the grid, so you can follow and tap the whole solution at your own pace. Also fixed a hint that could stall after a rewarded ad.",
      "seenAt": "2026-06-18T21:23:21Z"
    },
    {
